{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QqfMdMs7pVPLRaZtLi7Y1K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental results for each planned experiment in the experiment plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. I need to provide result_rationale for each prediction explaining why we'd get those results in this best-case tier.\n\nLet me carefully go through each experiment and generate realistic \"best\" tier predictions based on the context provided.\n\nKey metrics ranges for \"best\" tier:\n- acr_vla_libero_plus_success_gain_abs: [12, 18]\n- a3_ablation_gap_no_conformal_vs_full: [8, 15]\n\n\n- a4_ablation_gap_scalar_vs_perDOF: [4, 8]\n- coc_success_spearman_rho: [0.5, 0.7]\n- aci_ellipsoid_volume_narrowing_pct: [20, 35]\n- srpo_stacking_gain_abs: [5, 8]\n- srpo_stacked_absolute: [87, 90]\n- libero_nominal_drop: [0, 1]\n- perturbation_dims_with_significant_gain: [5, 7]\n\nI'm establishing the core assumptions that underpin these predictions, starting with the assumption that flow-matching VLA samples have sufficient quality and diversity to support the expected performance gains.\n\nNow I'm mapping out the experimental plan across eight planned runs, with plan_000 already completed and the remaining experiments covering the full pipeline on SmolVLA, various ablations removing different components, and perturbation-specific analyses.\n\nFor the full pipeline test, I'm predicting SmolVLA hits around 97% on LIBERO nominal but drops to 55-60% on LIBERO-Plus due to typical robustness gaps, then ACR-VLA should recover that to roughly 70-73% with the best-tier gains of 12-18 points while maintaining near-nominal performance on the original benchmark.\n\nNow looking at the ablation studies—removing conformal prediction should cost us 8-15% in best tier, putting A3 around 58-62%, while the scalar ablation would be lighter at 4-8% loss bringing A4 to 64-66%. For SRPO stacking, I'm expecting the baseline of 82.1% to improve by 5-8% when stacked, reaching 87-90%. The COC validation should show Spearman correlation between 0.5-0.7 with ellipsoid volume narrowing of 20-35%, and without ACI the performance would remain static.\n\nRemoving CRM entirely would hurt more than losing ACI—dropping 8-12% compared to 4-6%—since it handles the sample selection that ACI can't do alone. The per-perturbation analysis should reveal 5-7 dimensions with meaningful gains, concentrated on camera, noise, and robot-state shifts. For the statistical method comparison, CGS with joint Mahalanobis should edge out Bonferroni by 3-5%, while COC should match or slightly beat episode-level approaches without needing external labels. Finally, CGS epistemic uncertainty should outperform DiU's aleatoric approach under distribution shift, though combining them might offer marginal improvements.\n\nFor feature importance, conformal radius emerges as the strongest signal, with per-DOF standard deviation mattering most for camera and noise perturbations. SnapFlow with K=10 and 1-step rollouts should deliver 5-8x speedup at the cost of just 1-2% performance.\n\nNow I'm working through the baseline numbers more carefully—LIBERO-Plus with perturbations suggests a base SmolVLA around 58%, which means ACR-VLA's 15 percentage point gain would push us to roughly 73%.\n\nFor the nominal LIBERO benchmark, I'm expecting the base to sit around 97%, with ACR-VLA preserving most of that performance, dropping only 0-1%.\n\nWriting the full YAML specification...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11066,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11066},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2723979-e9f9-4088-b123-1516654979e0","uuid":"6352597d-b1f3-4519-99f9-4f93cb40d9f1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QqfMdMs7pVPLRaZtLi7Y1K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完整成立。标题级 claim: \"Inference-time dimension-selective conformal correction provides orthogonal gains to training-time methods.\"\n  三条 claims 全部通过 kill criteria。Headline: ACR-VLA 在 LIBERO-Plus 上将 base VLA 提升 ~15 pp，叠加 SRPO 达到 ~89% 新 SOTA。\n  Per-DOF vs scalar ablation 提供 clean 机制验证。COC 作为自参考信号的有效性是独立贡献点。可冲 CoRL oral/spotlight。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"MVP Point-Reaching\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_000\"\n    description: \"3D point-reaching 环境下 per-DOF vs scalar vs no uncertainty conditioning 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE\n      conclusion: SUCCESS\n      group4_K10_perDOF_total_mse: 0.0735\n      group4_K10_scalar_total_mse: 0.0788\n      group4_K10_none_total_mse: 0.0882\n      perDOF_vs_none_improvement_pct: 16.7\n      perDOF_vs_scalar_improvement_pct: 6.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成实验。K=10 Ledoit-Wolf 条件下 per-DOF 对 none 有 16.7% MSE 改善，\n      对 scalar 有 6.7% 改善。X 维度（高噪声维度）上 per-DOF 优势最显著，\n      Y/Z 维度 per-DOF 也优于 scalar，验证了跨维度协方差结构可被利用。\n      Oracle covariance 到 K=10 estimated 的衰减约 15pp 但 ranking 保持一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S1: MVP Point-Reaching MSE Comparison\"\n        description: \"6 组实验 × 3 条件的完整 MSE 分解\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S1: Per-DOF MSE bar chart (oracle vs K=10), 展示 X/Y/Z 各维度上三种条件的对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      MVP 验证了核心假设：(1) per-DOF > scalar > none 的 ranking 在 K=10 下保持；\n      (2) 高噪声维度获益最大；(3) Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 有效控制了 K=10 的协方差估计误差。\n      为 VLA 全管线实验提供了信心。\n\n  - name: \"ACR-VLA Full Pipeline on SmolVLA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"CGS + ACI/COC + CRM 全管线。CRM 在 LIBERO demos + synthetic augmentation 上训练。评估 LIBERO 名义 + LIBERO-Plus L3-L5。\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_smolvla_libero_nominal_success: 97.3\n      base_smolvla_libero_plus_success: 57.8\n      acr_vla_libero_nominal_success: 96.5\n      acr_vla_libero_plus_success: 72.8\n      acr_vla_libero_plus_success_gain_abs: 15.0\n      libero_nominal_drop: 0.8\n      crm_param_count: 131072\n      cgs_K: 10\n      cgs_shrinkage: \"ledoit-wolf\"\n      aci_target_coverage: 0.90\n      inference_overhead_ms: 12.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下全部五条核心假设成立。(1) SmolVLA flow-matching 样本的 inter-sample 协方差结构充分：\n      7-DOF action 空间中不同维度在分布偏移下展现差异化不确定性膨胀，CGS 提取的 45D 特征\n      (15-DOF × {std, conformal_radius, ellipsoid_volume}) 编码了可利用的结构。\n      (2) K=10 + Ledoit-Wolf 在 p/n=0.7 条件下产生足够准确的协方差估计，\n      条件数从 ~10^4 降至 ~10^2，使 Mahalanobis 距离有意义。\n      (3) Synthetic augmentation 覆盖了 camera/noise/robot-state/light/background 5 类扰动，\n      CRM 学到了维度选择性校正模式。(4) ACI+COC 在 LIBERO-Plus 上在线适应 conformal threshold，\n      补偿了 synthetic 训练集未覆盖的 layout/language 偏移。\n      名义 LIBERO 几乎无衰减因为 CRM 学到了\"低 uncertainty 时少干预\"——conformal radius 在 nominal\n      条件下窄，CRM 的残差输出接近零。15pp 增益分布不均匀，主要来自 camera (+20pp)、\n      sensor noise (+18pp)、robot-state perturbation (+17pp) 等 CGS 可检测的连续偏移。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: LIBERO & LIBERO-Plus Success Rate\"\n        description: \"Base SmolVLA vs ACR-VLA, per-task & aggregate, nominal + L3-L5 perturbation levels\"\n      - name: \"Table 2: Inference Overhead Breakdown\"\n        description: \"K=10 sampling, CGS computation, CRM forward pass 的延迟分解\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: LIBERO-Plus success rate by perturbation level (L3/L4/L5), base vs ACR-VLA\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Ellipsoid volume heatmap across 7 DOFs × perturbation types, showing dimension-selective uncertainty inflation\"\n    analysis: >\n      15pp 绝对增益落在 best 档 [12,18] 中间偏上。CRM 在高不确定性维度（通常是 xyz 平移）\n      上施加较大校正，在低不确定性维度（gripper）上几乎不干预。\n      名义 LIBERO 仅下降 0.8pp，在统计误差范围内，满足 [0,1] 约束。\n      131K 参数 CRM 的推理开销 ~12ms 可忽略。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A3 — CRM without Conformal Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"CRM 仅接收 observation embedding 作为输入，无 45D conformal 特征。等价于 A2C2-style generic residual。Claim 1 的 make-or-break。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a3_libero_plus_success: 60.8\n      a3_ablation_gap_no_conformal_vs_full: 12.0\n      a3_libero_nominal_success: 96.2\n      a3_vs_base_gain: 3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      无 conformal 特征时，CRM 退化为盲目残差预测器。它仍能通过 observation embedding\n      学到\"某些场景可能需要校正\"的粗粒度信号，带来 ~3pp 微弱增益（类似 A2C2 的效果）。\n      但失去了维度选择性：不知道哪些 DOF 不确定，只能在所有维度上施加相似幅度的残差，\n      导致在确定维度上引入不必要扰动。12pp 的差距（best 档 [8,15] 区间内）\n      确认了 conformal 特征是 ACR-VLA 有效性的核心驱动因素，而非 CRM 架构本身。\n      这个差距远超 kill criterion (>2%)，Claim 1 安全通过。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A3 ablation results\"\n        description: \"A3 vs full ACR-VLA 在 LIBERO-Plus 各 perturbation level 上的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 (ablation bar chart) 中 A3 对应的柱\"\n    analysis: >\n      12pp 差距提供了 Claim 1 的最强证据。per-DOF conformal 特征不仅仅是\"有帮助\"，\n      而是 ACR-VLA 有效性的主要来源。A3 在各 perturbation type 上均弱于 full，\n      但在 camera/noise 上差距最大（因为这些扰动产生的 uncertainty 结构最丰富）。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A4 — CRM with Scalar Uncertainty\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"CRM 使用 scalar Euclidean distance (à la ReconVLA) 替代 45D per-DOF 特征。验证 per-DOF > scalar。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a4_libero_plus_success: 66.8\n      a4_ablation_gap_scalar_vs_perDOF: 6.0\n      a4_libero_nominal_success: 96.4\n      a4_vs_base_gain: 9.0\n      a4_vs_a3_gap: 6.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      标量 uncertainty（样本集的 Euclidean 距离均值/方差）仍然携带有意义的信息：\n      \"整体上这个时间步不确定\"。CRM 可以据此调整残差幅度（不确定时校正更多），\n      比 A3 的盲目残差好得多（+6pp）。但它丢失了跨维度区分——当 xyz 高度不确定而\n      rotation 确定时，标量信号无法让 CRM 只校正 xyz。这导致两类损失：\n      (a) 在确定维度上的不必要干预，(b) 在高度不确定维度上校正不足（因为幅度被平均化）。\n      6pp 差距（best 档 [4,8]）验证了 per-DOF 结构的独特价值，且与 MVP 中 per-DOF vs scalar\n      的 6.7% MSE 改善趋势一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A4 ablation results\"\n        description: \"A4 vs A3 vs full 三路对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 (ablation bar chart) 中 A4 对应的柱\"\n      - \"Fig 5: Per-DOF correction magnitude visualization — A4(scalar) 在所有 DOF 上近似均匀 vs full(per-DOF) 的选择性模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      A4 vs A3 的 6pp 差距说明即使是粗粒度 scalar uncertainty 也有价值。\n      A4 vs full 的 6pp 差距说明 per-DOF 结构提供了额外的等量价值。\n      形成了清晰的 none < scalar < per-DOF 梯度，机制可解释。\n\n  - name: \"ACR-VLA Stacked on SRPO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"在 SRPO-finetuned SmolVLA (82.1% LIBERO-Plus SOTA) 上部署 ACR-VLA。训练新 CRM。\"\n    expected_results:\n      srpo_baseline_libero_plus: 82.1\n      acr_srpo_libero_plus_success: 88.7\n      srpo_stacking_gain_abs: 6.6\n      srpo_stacked_absolute: 88.7\n      acr_srpo_libero_nominal: 97.8\n      srpo_libero_nominal: 98.1\n      stacking_nominal_drop: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下第五条假设成立：SRPO 的 RL fine-tuning 虽然收窄了策略分布，但并未完全\n      消除 epistemic uncertainty 结构。关键机制：SRPO 优化了训练分布上的 expected reward\n      但未见过 LIBERO-Plus 的测试时扰动，因此 flow-matching 在 OOD 条件下仍展现\n      差异化的 per-DOF 不确定性——只是基线成功率更高，绝对增益空间更小。\n      6.6pp 增益（best 档 [5,8]）主要来自 SRPO 仍然失败的 harder perturbation cases\n      (L4-L5 level camera shift, compound perturbations)。这些 case 中 SRPO 的 action\n      prediction 质量虽优于 base VLA，但仍有系统性偏差，CGS 可检测到并由 CRM 校正。\n      88.7% 绝对值（best 档 [87,90]）构成 LIBERO-Plus 新 SOTA，且由两个正交方法\n      (training-time RL + inference-time conformal correction) 叠加而成。\n      名义 LIBERO 几乎无衰减：SRPO checkpoint 在 nominal 下 uncertainty 极低，\n      CRM 的残差自然趋近于零。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1 rows: SRPO baseline, ACR-VLA+SRPO\"\n        description: \"SRPO vs ACR-VLA+SRPO 在 LIBERO 和 LIBERO-Plus 各级别上的对比\"\n      - name: \"Table 4: Stacking Analysis\"\n        description: \"Base VLA / ACR-VLA / SRPO / ACR-VLA+SRPO 四路交叉对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: Stacking bar chart — 四种配置在 LIBERO-Plus L3/L4/L5 上的成功率\"\n      - \"Fig 7: Venn diagram of failure cases — ACR-VLA alone vs SRPO alone vs stacked 的失败集合交集分析\"\n    analysis: >\n      6.6pp stacking gain 远超 kill criterion (>2%)，Claim 3 安全通过。\n      失败集合分析是关键证据：ACR-VLA 和 SRPO 各自修复的 failure case 交集很小（<30%），\n      说明二者确实正交。SRPO 修复的主要是 policy quality 问题（action mean 偏差），\n      ACR-VLA 修复的主要是 uncertainty-driven 问题（高 variance 维度上的 outlier action）。\n      88.7% 标题数字有力支撑\"orthogonal gains\"叙事。\n\n  - name: \"COC Signal Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"COC coverage fraction 与 task success 的 Spearman ρ；ACI 收敛曲线；ellipsoid volume vs static calibration。\"\n    expected_results:\n      coc_success_spearman_rho: 0.61\n      coc_spearman_p_value: 0.00003\n      aci_converged_episodes: 47\n      aci_convergence_steps_median: 85\n      aci_mean_coverage_after_convergence: 0.893\n      aci_ellipsoid_volume_narrowing_pct: 28.0\n      static_calibration_coverage_actual: 0.78\n      aci_calibration_coverage_actual: 0.89\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下第三条假设成立：COC chunk overlap consistency 与 task success 存在强相关。\n      机制：成功 trajectory 中相邻 chunk 预测的重叠区域高度一致（overlap consistency > 0.85），\n      因为 VLA 在正确执行时对未来 action 的预测稳定。失败 trajectory 中 VLA 的预测在\n      连续时间步间波动，overlap consistency 下降到 0.4-0.6。\n      ρ=0.61（best 档 [0.5,0.7]）反映了这不是完美信号（有些失败 case 中 VLA 自信但错误），\n      但足以作为有效的 ACI 更新信号。\n      ACI 使用 COC 信号在线调整 conformal threshold：高 COC 时收紧（减小 ellipsoid），\n      低 COC 时放松（增大 ellipsoid）。28% 的 volume narrowing（best 档 [20,35]）\n      意味着 ACI 在分布偏移下能动态收缩到比 static calibration 更紧的 conformal set，\n      同时维持 ~0.89 的有效覆盖率。Static calibration 在 LIBERO-Plus 上实际覆盖率\n      降至 0.78（因为 calibration set 和 test 分布不匹配），ACI 修复了这个问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: COC-Success Correlation Analysis\"\n        description: \"Spearman ρ, p-value, per-task breakdown\"\n      - name: \"Table 6: ACI vs Static Calibration\"\n        description: \"Coverage, ellipsoid volume, success rate 的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: Scatter plot — episode COC coverage fraction vs binary task success, with marginal histograms\"\n      - \"Fig 9: ACI convergence curve — running coverage rate over episodes, with target 0.9 line\"\n      - \"Fig 10: Ellipsoid volume time series — ACI (adaptive) vs static, showing narrowing under distribution shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.61 是 Claim 2 的核心证据。COC 作为 self-referential 信号不需要外部 reward，\n      这是区别于 episode-level ACI (需要 task success label) 的关键优势。\n      28% volume narrowing 说明 ACI 不只是维持覆盖——它在提供更紧（更有信息量）的 conformal set。\n      ACI 的 0.89 vs static 的 0.78 实际覆盖率差异直接说明了在线适应的价值。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A1 — No ACI (Static Calibration)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"CRM 使用 static CGS calibration，无在线 ACI 更新。隔离 ACI 贡献。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a1_libero_plus_success: 68.2\n      a1_vs_full_gap: 4.6\n      a1_libero_nominal_success: 96.8\n      a1_effective_coverage_libero_plus: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 ACI 后，conformal threshold 固定在 calibration set 上的值。在 LIBERO nominal\n      上几乎无差异（分布匹配，static 和 adaptive 给出类似 threshold）。\n      但在 LIBERO-Plus 上，分布偏移使得 static threshold 过于宽松或过于严格\n      （取决于具体 perturbation type）：camera shift 下 uncertainty 系统性增大但 static\n      threshold 不变，导致 conformal set 过大，CRM 得到的特征信噪比下降。\n      4.6pp 差距说明 ACI 的自适应能力贡献显著但非主导——CRM + static CGS 本身仍然\n      捕获了大部分 per-DOF 结构信息，只是 calibration 不够精准。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A1 ablation\"\n        description: \"A1 vs full 在各 perturbation level 上的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 中 A1 对应的柱\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.6pp 差距确认 ACI 是有价值的组件，但不是 ACR-VLA 有效性的主要来源。\n      主要价值在分布偏移更大的 L4-L5 level 显现（L3 几乎无差异）。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A2 — No CRM (CGS + COC + Sample Selection Only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"只用 CGS + COC + ACI 做样本选择（选择 Mahalanobis 距离最小的样本），不做学习型残差校正。类似 ReconVLA 的多元扩展。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a2_libero_plus_success: 63.5\n      a2_vs_full_gap: 9.3\n      a2_vs_base_gain: 5.7\n      a2_libero_nominal_success: 97.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      样本选择（从 K=10 中选最优）能提供一定增益：在 conformal ellipsoid 内选择\n      Mahalanobis 距离最小的样本，倾向于选择\"最不 outlier\"的 action。\n      但天花板很低——它只能选择已有样本，不能合成更优的 action。当所有 K=10 样本\n      在某些 DOF 上都有偏差时（系统性分布偏移），选择最好的样本仍然有显著误差。\n      CRM 的价值在于它能合成一个优于任何单个样本的 corrected action——特别是\n      在不同 DOF 上从不同样本\"借鉴\"最佳预测。9.3pp 差距量化了\"选择 vs 校正\"的价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A2 ablation\"\n        description: \"A2 vs full vs A1 在 LIBERO-Plus 上的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 中 A2 对应的柱\"\n    analysis: >\n      A2 > base (5.7pp) 说明即使没有 CRM，结构化 multivariate CP 做样本选择也有价值\n      （优于 ReconVLA 的标量选择）。但 A2 << full (9.3pp 差距) 确认 CRM 的学习型\n      校正是 ACR-VLA 效果的主要来源。这为论文提供了清晰的 contribution decomposition。\n\n  - name: \"Per-Perturbation-Dimension Breakdown\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"ACR-VLA gain 在 7 种 LIBERO-Plus perturbation 维度上的分解。\"\n    expected_results:\n      perturbation_dims_with_significant_gain: 6\n      gain_camera: 19.5\n      gain_sensor_noise: 17.8\n      gain_robot_state: 16.2\n      gain_lighting: 13.4\n      gain_background: 11.8\n      gain_layout: 5.2\n      gain_language: 2.1\n      gain_camera_p_value: 0.001\n      gain_sensor_noise_p_value: 0.002\n      gain_robot_state_p_value: 0.003\n      gain_lighting_p_value: 0.008\n      gain_background_p_value: 0.015\n      gain_layout_p_value: 0.042\n      gain_language_p_value: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下 6/7 维度显示显著增益（best 档 [5,7]）。增益梯度与 CGS 可检测性直接相关：\n      (1) Camera perturbation (+19.5pp)：视角变化导致 VLA 的 action prediction 在 xyz 平移维度上\n      产生强烈的 inter-sample variance 膨胀和跨维度协方差变化，CGS 特征最丰富。\n      (2) Sensor noise (+17.8pp)：直接扰动 action 空间，CGS 立即检测到 per-DOF variance 变化。\n      (3) Robot-state perturbation (+16.2pp)：状态空间偏移导致 VLA 对某些 DOF 的预测\n      系统性偏移，CRM 学到了针对性校正。\n      (4) Lighting (+13.4pp)：影响视觉特征，间接导致 action uncertainty 升高但仍可检测。\n      (5) Background (+11.8pp)：类似 lighting 但效果稍弱。\n      (6) Layout (+5.2pp, p=0.042)：物体位置变化需要策略层面的适应，CGS 能检测到部分\n      不确定性但 CRM 的 synthetic training 未充分覆盖 layout 变化，增益有限。\n      (7) Language (+2.1pp, p=0.31)：语言指令变化不影响 action space 的 uncertainty 结构，\n      CGS 几乎检测不到（语言变化不改变 flow-matching 采样分布的协方差），不显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Per-Perturbation Gain Breakdown\"\n        description: \"7 维度 × {base, ACR-VLA, gain, p-value} 完整表格\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 11: Horizontal bar chart — per-perturbation absolute gain with 95% CI\"\n      - \"Fig 12: Heatmap — 7 perturbation types × 7 action DOFs, showing CRM correction magnitude\"\n    analysis: >\n      camera/noise/robot-state 三类\"CGS 可检测\"的连续偏移占据了最大增益，符合预期。\n      layout 增益较小但仍显著（p<0.05），说明 ACI 在线适应部分弥补了训练集的不足。\n      language 不显著是 honest limitation——语言变化属于语义层面，不改变 action 的\n      epistemic uncertainty 结构。论文可将此作为 limitation 讨论并指出未来方向。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A5 — CGS (Joint Mahalanobis) vs Per-DOF Bonferroni\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"比较联合 Mahalanobis 非conformity score 与 per-DOF Bonferroni 校正的独立 CP。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a5_bonferroni_libero_plus_success: 69.4\n      a5_vs_full_gap: 3.4\n      a5_bonferroni_effective_coverage: 0.86\n      a5_bonferroni_ellipsoid_volume_ratio: 1.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Bonferroni 校正对 7 个 DOF 独立做 CP，将 per-DOF 覆盖率设为 1-(α/7) 以保证\n      联合覆盖。这有两个损失：(1) 过度保守——Bonferroni 假设最坏情况独立性，\n      实际维度间存在正相关，导致 conformal set 过大（volume 比 CGS 大 35%）；\n      (2) 丢失跨维度协方差信息——CGS 的 Mahalanobis 距离编码了\"xyz 一起偏 vs 只有 x 偏\"\n      的区别，Bonferroni 无法捕获这一结构。3.4pp 差距虽不巨大但一致，\n      验证了 multivariate CP (CGS) 相比 naive per-DOF CP 的优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S2: CGS vs Bonferroni CP Comparison\"\n        description: \"Coverage, volume, CRM downstream success rate\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S2: Conformal ellipsoid vs Bonferroni box — 2D projection 可视化 (选择协方差最大的两个 DOF)\"\n    analysis: >\n      3.4pp 差距说明 CGS 的联合 Mahalanobis approach 有实际价值，但主要效果来自\n      更紧的 conformal set（volume 小 26%）给 CRM 提供了更高信噪比的特征。\n      这是 supplementary 级别的结果，支撑方法论选择但不构成独立 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A6 — COC Signal vs Episode-Level Task Success for ACI\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"对比 COC (per-step self-referential) 和 episode-level task success (外部监督) 作为 ACI 更新信号。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a6_episode_aci_libero_plus_success: 72.1\n      a6_coc_aci_libero_plus_success: 72.8\n      a6_gap: 0.7\n      a6_episode_aci_convergence_speed_episodes: 120\n      a6_coc_aci_convergence_speed_episodes: 47\n      a6_coc_advantage_early_episodes_success: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      COC 和 episode-level ACI 在充分收敛后达到相似的最终性能（差距 <1pp），\n      因为两者最终都收敛到正确的 conformal threshold。但 COC 有两个关键优势：\n      (1) 收敛速度快 2.5x（47 vs 120 episodes），因为 COC 提供 per-step 信号（每步一个\n      consistency 分数）而 episode-level 仅提供 per-episode 二值信号（成功/失败）；\n      (2) 不需要外部 task success 标签——部署时可能没有 reward signal。\n      早期 episode（前 50 个）中 COC-ACI 比 episode-ACI 高 4.2pp，\n      说明快速适应在实际部署中有价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S3: COC-ACI vs Episode-ACI\"\n        description: \"Convergence speed, final performance, early performance\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S3: ACI convergence curve — COC vs episode-level, showing faster convergence of COC\"\n    analysis: >\n      最终性能近似说明 ACI 的 asymptotic 行为不依赖信号源质量（只要信号与 coverage\n      相关，最终都收敛到 target coverage）。COC 的价值在于 (a) 收敛速度, (b) 无需外部监督。\n      这是 Claim 2 的\"自参考\"子论点的独立验证。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A7 — DiU Aleatoric vs CGS Epistemic Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"CRM 分别使用 DiU aleatoric features (7D)、CGS epistemic features (45D)、combined (52D) 作为输入。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a7_diu_aleatoric_libero_plus_success: 63.9\n      a7_cgs_epistemic_libero_plus_success: 72.8\n      a7_combined_52d_libero_plus_success: 73.5\n      a7_diu_vs_cgs_gap: 8.9\n      a7_combined_vs_cgs_gap: 0.7\n      a7_diu_libero_nominal_success: 94.8\n      a7_diu_nominal_drop: 2.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      DiU 估计的 aleatoric uncertainty 反映数据固有噪声，在 nominal 和 OOD 条件下\n      都可能较高（如 gripper action 本身就有 stochasticity）。这导致两个问题：\n      (1) 在 nominal 条件下 CRM 过度干预（2.5pp drop），因为 aleatoric uncertainty\n      在正常情况下也不为零，CRM 无法区分\"固有噪声\"和\"需要校正\"；\n      (2) 在 OOD 条件下信号不如 epistemic 清晰——CGS 的 epistemic uncertainty 在\n      分布偏移时显著升高而在 nominal 时低，提供了更干净的\"是否需要校正\"信号。\n      Combined 52D 仅比 CGS 45D 好 0.7pp：aleatoric 信息的边际价值很小，\n      因为 epistemic features 已经捕获了绝大部分可利用的结构。\n      这验证了 paper framing 中\"CGS captures epistemic, DiU captures aleatoric\"的区分，\n      以及 epistemic uncertainty 对 action correction 更有用的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S4: Epistemic vs Aleatoric Uncertainty Features\"\n        description: \"DiU / CGS / Combined 三路对比, nominal + LIBERO-Plus\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S4: Per-DOF uncertainty magnitude — DiU vs CGS 在 nominal 和 OOD 条件下的分布对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      8.9pp 差距是对 reviewer concern \"DiU 更高效\" 的直接回应：效率不是唯一考量，\n      epistemic vs aleatoric 的信号质量差异更重要。DiU 在 nominal 上的 2.5pp drop\n      是额外的 evidence point——aleatoric conditioning 在没有分布偏移时反而有害。\n      Combined 的微弱改善不 justify 52D 的额外复杂度，支持了 45D CGS-only 的设计选择。\n\n  - name: \"Feature Importance Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"CRM 对 45 个 uncertainty 特征的梯度 magnitude 分析，按 perturbation type 分解。\"\n    expected_results:\n      top_features_overall: [\"conformal_radius_x\", \"conformal_radius_y\", \"conformal_radius_z\", \"std_x\", \"ellipsoid_volume\", \"std_y\"]\n      conformal_radius_gradient_share: 0.48\n      std_gradient_share: 0.31\n      ellipsoid_volume_gradient_share: 0.21\n      camera_perturbation_top_feature: \"conformal_radius_x\"\n      noise_perturbation_top_feature: \"std_z\"\n      robot_state_top_feature: \"conformal_radius_joint3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conformal radius 是最重要的特征类别（48% gradient share），因为它直接编码了\n      \"在该 DOF 上 conformal set 有多宽\"——这是 calibrated 的 uncertainty measure，\n      比 raw std 更稳定。Per-DOF std 次之（31%），提供互补的 raw dispersion 信息。\n      Ellipsoid volume（全局标量）虽然只有 21% 但在所有 perturbation type 上贡献一致，\n      作为\"整体 uncertainty level\"的 contextual feature。\n      关键发现：不同 perturbation type 下 CRM 关注的 DOF 不同——camera shift 主要\n      影响 xyz 平移因此 conformal_radius_{x,y,z} 梯度高；robot-state perturbation\n      主要影响关节角因此 conformal_radius_joint* 梯度高。这是\"维度选择性校正\"的\n      直接机制证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Feature Importance by Category\"\n        description: \"3 feature categories × 7 perturbation types 的 gradient magnitude matrix\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 13: Feature importance heatmap — 45 features × 7 perturbation types, gradient magnitude\"\n      - \"Fig 14: Top-3 features per perturbation type, showing dimension-selective attention pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      Feature importance 分析提供了 Claim 1 的机制解释：CRM 不是黑盒——它确实在利用\n      per-DOF conformal 结构做维度选择性校正。不同 perturbation 下关注不同 DOF 的模式\n      与物理直觉一致。这是 reviewer 最可能 appreciate 的 interpretability result。\n\n  - name: \"SnapFlow Integration — K=10 × 1-Step Distilled Sampling\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"用 SnapFlow 1-step distilled generation 替代标准 flow-matching 多步采样。测试样本多样性和推理加速。\"\n    expected_results:\n      snapflow_libero_plus_success: 71.2\n      snapflow_vs_full_gap: 1.6\n      snapflow_sample_diversity_ratio: 0.87\n      snapflow_inference_time_ms: 38\n      standard_inference_time_ms: 185\n      snapflow_speedup: 4.9\n      snapflow_libero_nominal_success: 96.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      SnapFlow 1-step distilled generation 将 K=10 的采样时间从 ~185ms 降至 ~38ms\n      (4.9x speedup)，因为跳过了 flow-matching 的迭代 ODE 求解。\n      样本多样性保留 87%（用 K=10 样本集的 average pairwise distance 衡量）：\n      distillation 轻微压缩了分布尾部，但核心的 inter-sample covariance 结构保留。\n      LIBERO-Plus 上仅损失 1.6pp，因为 CGS 在稍低多样性下仍能提取有意义的\n      per-DOF 特征——Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 对 slightly lower effective K 鲁棒。\n      这为实时部署场景提供了 practical speedup 且性能损失可接受。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S5: SnapFlow vs Standard Sampling\"\n        description: \"Inference time, sample diversity, downstream success\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S5: Inference time breakdown — standard vs SnapFlow, showing per-component cost\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.9x speedup 在 1.6pp 代价下是合理的 engineering tradeoff。\n      87% 样本多样性保留说明 1-step distillation 保留了足够的 epistemic information。\n      这不是核心科学贡献但是重要的 practical result，回应了 reviewer 可能的\n      \"K=10 采样太慢\" concern。可放在 supplementary 或 practical considerations section。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11066,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11066},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2723979-e9f9-4088-b123-1516654979e0","uuid":"8634c39b-a106-4bf7-90d5-287758cd84f6"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":248926,"duration_api_ms":250273,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完整成立。标题级 claim: \"Inference-time dimension-selective conformal correction provides orthogonal gains to training-time methods.\"\n  三条 claims 全部通过 kill criteria。Headline: ACR-VLA 在 LIBERO-Plus 上将 base VLA 提升 ~15 pp，叠加 SRPO 达到 ~89% 新 SOTA。\n  Per-DOF vs scalar ablation 提供 clean 机制验证。COC 作为自参考信号的有效性是独立贡献点。可冲 CoRL oral/spotlight。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"MVP Point-Reaching\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_000\"\n    description: \"3D point-reaching 环境下 per-DOF vs scalar vs no uncertainty conditioning 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: DONE\n      conclusion: SUCCESS\n      group4_K10_perDOF_total_mse: 0.0735\n      group4_K10_scalar_total_mse: 0.0788\n      group4_K10_none_total_mse: 0.0882\n      perDOF_vs_none_improvement_pct: 16.7\n      perDOF_vs_scalar_improvement_pct: 6.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成实验。K=10 Ledoit-Wolf 条件下 per-DOF 对 none 有 16.7% MSE 改善，\n      对 scalar 有 6.7% 改善。X 维度（高噪声维度）上 per-DOF 优势最显著，\n      Y/Z 维度 per-DOF 也优于 scalar，验证了跨维度协方差结构可被利用。\n      Oracle covariance 到 K=10 estimated 的衰减约 15pp 但 ranking 保持一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S1: MVP Point-Reaching MSE Comparison\"\n        description: \"6 组实验 × 3 条件的完整 MSE 分解\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S1: Per-DOF MSE bar chart (oracle vs K=10), 展示 X/Y/Z 各维度上三种条件的对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      MVP 验证了核心假设：(1) per-DOF > scalar > none 的 ranking 在 K=10 下保持；\n      (2) 高噪声维度获益最大；(3) Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 有效控制了 K=10 的协方差估计误差。\n      为 VLA 全管线实验提供了信心。\n\n  - name: \"ACR-VLA Full Pipeline on SmolVLA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"CGS + ACI/COC + CRM 全管线。CRM 在 LIBERO demos + synthetic augmentation 上训练。评估 LIBERO 名义 + LIBERO-Plus L3-L5。\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_smolvla_libero_nominal_success: 97.3\n      base_smolvla_libero_plus_success: 57.8\n      acr_vla_libero_nominal_success: 96.5\n      acr_vla_libero_plus_success: 72.8\n      acr_vla_libero_plus_success_gain_abs: 15.0\n      libero_nominal_drop: 0.8\n      crm_param_count: 131072\n      cgs_K: 10\n      cgs_shrinkage: \"ledoit-wolf\"\n      aci_target_coverage: 0.90\n      inference_overhead_ms: 12.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下全部五条核心假设成立。(1) SmolVLA flow-matching 样本的 inter-sample 协方差结构充分：\n      7-DOF action 空间中不同维度在分布偏移下展现差异化不确定性膨胀，CGS 提取的 45D 特征\n      (15-DOF × {std, conformal_radius, ellipsoid_volume}) 编码了可利用的结构。\n      (2) K=10 + Ledoit-Wolf 在 p/n=0.7 条件下产生足够准确的协方差估计，\n      条件数从 ~10^4 降至 ~10^2，使 Mahalanobis 距离有意义。\n      (3) Synthetic augmentation 覆盖了 camera/noise/robot-state/light/background 5 类扰动，\n      CRM 学到了维度选择性校正模式。(4) ACI+COC 在 LIBERO-Plus 上在线适应 conformal threshold，\n      补偿了 synthetic 训练集未覆盖的 layout/language 偏移。\n      名义 LIBERO 几乎无衰减因为 CRM 学到了\"低 uncertainty 时少干预\"——conformal radius 在 nominal\n      条件下窄，CRM 的残差输出接近零。15pp 增益分布不均匀，主要来自 camera (+20pp)、\n      sensor noise (+18pp)、robot-state perturbation (+17pp) 等 CGS 可检测的连续偏移。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: LIBERO & LIBERO-Plus Success Rate\"\n        description: \"Base SmolVLA vs ACR-VLA, per-task & aggregate, nominal + L3-L5 perturbation levels\"\n      - name: \"Table 2: Inference Overhead Breakdown\"\n        description: \"K=10 sampling, CGS computation, CRM forward pass 的延迟分解\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: LIBERO-Plus success rate by perturbation level (L3/L4/L5), base vs ACR-VLA\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Ellipsoid volume heatmap across 7 DOFs × perturbation types, showing dimension-selective uncertainty inflation\"\n    analysis: >\n      15pp 绝对增益落在 best 档 [12,18] 中间偏上。CRM 在高不确定性维度（通常是 xyz 平移）\n      上施加较大校正，在低不确定性维度（gripper）上几乎不干预。\n      名义 LIBERO 仅下降 0.8pp，在统计误差范围内，满足 [0,1] 约束。\n      131K 参数 CRM 的推理开销 ~12ms 可忽略。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A3 — CRM without Conformal Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"CRM 仅接收 observation embedding 作为输入，无 45D conformal 特征。等价于 A2C2-style generic residual。Claim 1 的 make-or-break。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a3_libero_plus_success: 60.8\n      a3_ablation_gap_no_conformal_vs_full: 12.0\n      a3_libero_nominal_success: 96.2\n      a3_vs_base_gain: 3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      无 conformal 特征时，CRM 退化为盲目残差预测器。它仍能通过 observation embedding\n      学到\"某些场景可能需要校正\"的粗粒度信号，带来 ~3pp 微弱增益（类似 A2C2 的效果）。\n      但失去了维度选择性：不知道哪些 DOF 不确定，只能在所有维度上施加相似幅度的残差，\n      导致在确定维度上引入不必要扰动。12pp 的差距（best 档 [8,15] 区间内）\n      确认了 conformal 特征是 ACR-VLA 有效性的核心驱动因素，而非 CRM 架构本身。\n      这个差距远超 kill criterion (>2%)，Claim 1 安全通过。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A3 ablation results\"\n        description: \"A3 vs full ACR-VLA 在 LIBERO-Plus 各 perturbation level 上的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 (ablation bar chart) 中 A3 对应的柱\"\n    analysis: >\n      12pp 差距提供了 Claim 1 的最强证据。per-DOF conformal 特征不仅仅是\"有帮助\"，\n      而是 ACR-VLA 有效性的主要来源。A3 在各 perturbation type 上均弱于 full，\n      但在 camera/noise 上差距最大（因为这些扰动产生的 uncertainty 结构最丰富）。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A4 — CRM with Scalar Uncertainty\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"CRM 使用 scalar Euclidean distance (à la ReconVLA) 替代 45D per-DOF 特征。验证 per-DOF > scalar。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a4_libero_plus_success: 66.8\n      a4_ablation_gap_scalar_vs_perDOF: 6.0\n      a4_libero_nominal_success: 96.4\n      a4_vs_base_gain: 9.0\n      a4_vs_a3_gap: 6.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      标量 uncertainty（样本集的 Euclidean 距离均值/方差）仍然携带有意义的信息：\n      \"整体上这个时间步不确定\"。CRM 可以据此调整残差幅度（不确定时校正更多），\n      比 A3 的盲目残差好得多（+6pp）。但它丢失了跨维度区分——当 xyz 高度不确定而\n      rotation 确定时，标量信号无法让 CRM 只校正 xyz。这导致两类损失：\n      (a) 在确定维度上的不必要干预，(b) 在高度不确定维度上校正不足（因为幅度被平均化）。\n      6pp 差距（best 档 [4,8]）验证了 per-DOF 结构的独特价值，且与 MVP 中 per-DOF vs scalar\n      的 6.7% MSE 改善趋势一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A4 ablation results\"\n        description: \"A4 vs A3 vs full 三路对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 (ablation bar chart) 中 A4 对应的柱\"\n      - \"Fig 5: Per-DOF correction magnitude visualization — A4(scalar) 在所有 DOF 上近似均匀 vs full(per-DOF) 的选择性模式\"\n    analysis: >\n      A4 vs A3 的 6pp 差距说明即使是粗粒度 scalar uncertainty 也有价值。\n      A4 vs full 的 6pp 差距说明 per-DOF 结构提供了额外的等量价值。\n      形成了清晰的 none < scalar < per-DOF 梯度，机制可解释。\n\n  - name: \"ACR-VLA Stacked on SRPO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"在 SRPO-finetuned SmolVLA (82.1% LIBERO-Plus SOTA) 上部署 ACR-VLA。训练新 CRM。\"\n    expected_results:\n      srpo_baseline_libero_plus: 82.1\n      acr_srpo_libero_plus_success: 88.7\n      srpo_stacking_gain_abs: 6.6\n      srpo_stacked_absolute: 88.7\n      acr_srpo_libero_nominal: 97.8\n      srpo_libero_nominal: 98.1\n      stacking_nominal_drop: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下第五条假设成立：SRPO 的 RL fine-tuning 虽然收窄了策略分布，但并未完全\n      消除 epistemic uncertainty 结构。关键机制：SRPO 优化了训练分布上的 expected reward\n      但未见过 LIBERO-Plus 的测试时扰动，因此 flow-matching 在 OOD 条件下仍展现\n      差异化的 per-DOF 不确定性——只是基线成功率更高，绝对增益空间更小。\n      6.6pp 增益（best 档 [5,8]）主要来自 SRPO 仍然失败的 harder perturbation cases\n      (L4-L5 level camera shift, compound perturbations)。这些 case 中 SRPO 的 action\n      prediction 质量虽优于 base VLA，但仍有系统性偏差，CGS 可检测到并由 CRM 校正。\n      88.7% 绝对值（best 档 [87,90]）构成 LIBERO-Plus 新 SOTA，且由两个正交方法\n      (training-time RL + inference-time conformal correction) 叠加而成。\n      名义 LIBERO 几乎无衰减：SRPO checkpoint 在 nominal 下 uncertainty 极低，\n      CRM 的残差自然趋近于零。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1 rows: SRPO baseline, ACR-VLA+SRPO\"\n        description: \"SRPO vs ACR-VLA+SRPO 在 LIBERO 和 LIBERO-Plus 各级别上的对比\"\n      - name: \"Table 4: Stacking Analysis\"\n        description: \"Base VLA / ACR-VLA / SRPO / ACR-VLA+SRPO 四路交叉对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: Stacking bar chart — 四种配置在 LIBERO-Plus L3/L4/L5 上的成功率\"\n      - \"Fig 7: Venn diagram of failure cases — ACR-VLA alone vs SRPO alone vs stacked 的失败集合交集分析\"\n    analysis: >\n      6.6pp stacking gain 远超 kill criterion (>2%)，Claim 3 安全通过。\n      失败集合分析是关键证据：ACR-VLA 和 SRPO 各自修复的 failure case 交集很小（<30%），\n      说明二者确实正交。SRPO 修复的主要是 policy quality 问题（action mean 偏差），\n      ACR-VLA 修复的主要是 uncertainty-driven 问题（高 variance 维度上的 outlier action）。\n      88.7% 标题数字有力支撑\"orthogonal gains\"叙事。\n\n  - name: \"COC Signal Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"COC coverage fraction 与 task success 的 Spearman ρ；ACI 收敛曲线；ellipsoid volume vs static calibration。\"\n    expected_results:\n      coc_success_spearman_rho: 0.61\n      coc_spearman_p_value: 0.00003\n      aci_converged_episodes: 47\n      aci_convergence_steps_median: 85\n      aci_mean_coverage_after_convergence: 0.893\n      aci_ellipsoid_volume_narrowing_pct: 28.0\n      static_calibration_coverage_actual: 0.78\n      aci_calibration_coverage_actual: 0.89\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下第三条假设成立：COC chunk overlap consistency 与 task success 存在强相关。\n      机制：成功 trajectory 中相邻 chunk 预测的重叠区域高度一致（overlap consistency > 0.85），\n      因为 VLA 在正确执行时对未来 action 的预测稳定。失败 trajectory 中 VLA 的预测在\n      连续时间步间波动，overlap consistency 下降到 0.4-0.6。\n      ρ=0.61（best 档 [0.5,0.7]）反映了这不是完美信号（有些失败 case 中 VLA 自信但错误），\n      但足以作为有效的 ACI 更新信号。\n      ACI 使用 COC 信号在线调整 conformal threshold：高 COC 时收紧（减小 ellipsoid），\n      低 COC 时放松（增大 ellipsoid）。28% 的 volume narrowing（best 档 [20,35]）\n      意味着 ACI 在分布偏移下能动态收缩到比 static calibration 更紧的 conformal set，\n      同时维持 ~0.89 的有效覆盖率。Static calibration 在 LIBERO-Plus 上实际覆盖率\n      降至 0.78（因为 calibration set 和 test 分布不匹配），ACI 修复了这个问题。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: COC-Success Correlation Analysis\"\n        description: \"Spearman ρ, p-value, per-task breakdown\"\n      - name: \"Table 6: ACI vs Static Calibration\"\n        description: \"Coverage, ellipsoid volume, success rate 的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: Scatter plot — episode COC coverage fraction vs binary task success, with marginal histograms\"\n      - \"Fig 9: ACI convergence curve — running coverage rate over episodes, with target 0.9 line\"\n      - \"Fig 10: Ellipsoid volume time series — ACI (adaptive) vs static, showing narrowing under distribution shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      ρ=0.61 是 Claim 2 的核心证据。COC 作为 self-referential 信号不需要外部 reward，\n      这是区别于 episode-level ACI (需要 task success label) 的关键优势。\n      28% volume narrowing 说明 ACI 不只是维持覆盖——它在提供更紧（更有信息量）的 conformal set。\n      ACI 的 0.89 vs static 的 0.78 实际覆盖率差异直接说明了在线适应的价值。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A1 — No ACI (Static Calibration)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"CRM 使用 static CGS calibration，无在线 ACI 更新。隔离 ACI 贡献。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a1_libero_plus_success: 68.2\n      a1_vs_full_gap: 4.6\n      a1_libero_nominal_success: 96.8\n      a1_effective_coverage_libero_plus: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 ACI 后，conformal threshold 固定在 calibration set 上的值。在 LIBERO nominal\n      上几乎无差异（分布匹配，static 和 adaptive 给出类似 threshold）。\n      但在 LIBERO-Plus 上，分布偏移使得 static threshold 过于宽松或过于严格\n      （取决于具体 perturbation type）：camera shift 下 uncertainty 系统性增大但 static\n      threshold 不变，导致 conformal set 过大，CRM 得到的特征信噪比下降。\n      4.6pp 差距说明 ACI 的自适应能力贡献显著但非主导——CRM + static CGS 本身仍然\n      捕获了大部分 per-DOF 结构信息，只是 calibration 不够精准。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A1 ablation\"\n        description: \"A1 vs full 在各 perturbation level 上的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 中 A1 对应的柱\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.6pp 差距确认 ACI 是有价值的组件，但不是 ACR-VLA 有效性的主要来源。\n      主要价值在分布偏移更大的 L4-L5 level 显现（L3 几乎无差异）。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A2 — No CRM (CGS + COC + Sample Selection Only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"只用 CGS + COC + ACI 做样本选择（选择 Mahalanobis 距离最小的样本），不做学习型残差校正。类似 ReconVLA 的多元扩展。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a2_libero_plus_success: 63.5\n      a2_vs_full_gap: 9.3\n      a2_vs_base_gain: 5.7\n      a2_libero_nominal_success: 97.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      样本选择（从 K=10 中选最优）能提供一定增益：在 conformal ellipsoid 内选择\n      Mahalanobis 距离最小的样本，倾向于选择\"最不 outlier\"的 action。\n      但天花板很低——它只能选择已有样本，不能合成更优的 action。当所有 K=10 样本\n      在某些 DOF 上都有偏差时（系统性分布偏移），选择最好的样本仍然有显著误差。\n      CRM 的价值在于它能合成一个优于任何单个样本的 corrected action——特别是\n      在不同 DOF 上从不同样本\"借鉴\"最佳预测。9.3pp 差距量化了\"选择 vs 校正\"的价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3 row: A2 ablation\"\n        description: \"A2 vs full vs A1 在 LIBERO-Plus 上的对比\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4 中 A2 对应的柱\"\n    analysis: >\n      A2 > base (5.7pp) 说明即使没有 CRM，结构化 multivariate CP 做样本选择也有价值\n      （优于 ReconVLA 的标量选择）。但 A2 << full (9.3pp 差距) 确认 CRM 的学习型\n      校正是 ACR-VLA 效果的主要来源。这为论文提供了清晰的 contribution decomposition。\n\n  - name: \"Per-Perturbation-Dimension Breakdown\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"ACR-VLA gain 在 7 种 LIBERO-Plus perturbation 维度上的分解。\"\n    expected_results:\n      perturbation_dims_with_significant_gain: 6\n      gain_camera: 19.5\n      gain_sensor_noise: 17.8\n      gain_robot_state: 16.2\n      gain_lighting: 13.4\n      gain_background: 11.8\n      gain_layout: 5.2\n      gain_language: 2.1\n      gain_camera_p_value: 0.001\n      gain_sensor_noise_p_value: 0.002\n      gain_robot_state_p_value: 0.003\n      gain_lighting_p_value: 0.008\n      gain_background_p_value: 0.015\n      gain_layout_p_value: 0.042\n      gain_language_p_value: 0.31\n    result_rationale: >\n      best 档下 6/7 维度显示显著增益（best 档 [5,7]）。增益梯度与 CGS 可检测性直接相关：\n      (1) Camera perturbation (+19.5pp)：视角变化导致 VLA 的 action prediction 在 xyz 平移维度上\n      产生强烈的 inter-sample variance 膨胀和跨维度协方差变化，CGS 特征最丰富。\n      (2) Sensor noise (+17.8pp)：直接扰动 action 空间，CGS 立即检测到 per-DOF variance 变化。\n      (3) Robot-state perturbation (+16.2pp)：状态空间偏移导致 VLA 对某些 DOF 的预测\n      系统性偏移，CRM 学到了针对性校正。\n      (4) Lighting (+13.4pp)：影响视觉特征，间接导致 action uncertainty 升高但仍可检测。\n      (5) Background (+11.8pp)：类似 lighting 但效果稍弱。\n      (6) Layout (+5.2pp, p=0.042)：物体位置变化需要策略层面的适应，CGS 能检测到部分\n      不确定性但 CRM 的 synthetic training 未充分覆盖 layout 变化，增益有限。\n      (7) Language (+2.1pp, p=0.31)：语言指令变化不影响 action space 的 uncertainty 结构，\n      CGS 几乎检测不到（语言变化不改变 flow-matching 采样分布的协方差），不显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Per-Perturbation Gain Breakdown\"\n        description: \"7 维度 × {base, ACR-VLA, gain, p-value} 完整表格\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 11: Horizontal bar chart — per-perturbation absolute gain with 95% CI\"\n      - \"Fig 12: Heatmap — 7 perturbation types × 7 action DOFs, showing CRM correction magnitude\"\n    analysis: >\n      camera/noise/robot-state 三类\"CGS 可检测\"的连续偏移占据了最大增益，符合预期。\n      layout 增益较小但仍显著（p<0.05），说明 ACI 在线适应部分弥补了训练集的不足。\n      language 不显著是 honest limitation——语言变化属于语义层面，不改变 action 的\n      epistemic uncertainty 结构。论文可将此作为 limitation 讨论并指出未来方向。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A5 — CGS (Joint Mahalanobis) vs Per-DOF Bonferroni\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"比较联合 Mahalanobis 非conformity score 与 per-DOF Bonferroni 校正的独立 CP。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a5_bonferroni_libero_plus_success: 69.4\n      a5_vs_full_gap: 3.4\n      a5_bonferroni_effective_coverage: 0.86\n      a5_bonferroni_ellipsoid_volume_ratio: 1.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Bonferroni 校正对 7 个 DOF 独立做 CP，将 per-DOF 覆盖率设为 1-(α/7) 以保证\n      联合覆盖。这有两个损失：(1) 过度保守——Bonferroni 假设最坏情况独立性，\n      实际维度间存在正相关，导致 conformal set 过大（volume 比 CGS 大 35%）；\n      (2) 丢失跨维度协方差信息——CGS 的 Mahalanobis 距离编码了\"xyz 一起偏 vs 只有 x 偏\"\n      的区别，Bonferroni 无法捕获这一结构。3.4pp 差距虽不巨大但一致，\n      验证了 multivariate CP (CGS) 相比 naive per-DOF CP 的优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S2: CGS vs Bonferroni CP Comparison\"\n        description: \"Coverage, volume, CRM downstream success rate\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S2: Conformal ellipsoid vs Bonferroni box — 2D projection 可视化 (选择协方差最大的两个 DOF)\"\n    analysis: >\n      3.4pp 差距说明 CGS 的联合 Mahalanobis approach 有实际价值，但主要效果来自\n      更紧的 conformal set（volume 小 26%）给 CRM 提供了更高信噪比的特征。\n      这是 supplementary 级别的结果，支撑方法论选择但不构成独立 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A6 — COC Signal vs Episode-Level Task Success for ACI\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"对比 COC (per-step self-referential) 和 episode-level task success (外部监督) 作为 ACI 更新信号。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a6_episode_aci_libero_plus_success: 72.1\n      a6_coc_aci_libero_plus_success: 72.8\n      a6_gap: 0.7\n      a6_episode_aci_convergence_speed_episodes: 120\n      a6_coc_aci_convergence_speed_episodes: 47\n      a6_coc_advantage_early_episodes_success: 4.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      COC 和 episode-level ACI 在充分收敛后达到相似的最终性能（差距 <1pp），\n      因为两者最终都收敛到正确的 conformal threshold。但 COC 有两个关键优势：\n      (1) 收敛速度快 2.5x（47 vs 120 episodes），因为 COC 提供 per-step 信号（每步一个\n      consistency 分数）而 episode-level 仅提供 per-episode 二值信号（成功/失败）；\n      (2) 不需要外部 task success 标签——部署时可能没有 reward signal。\n      早期 episode（前 50 个）中 COC-ACI 比 episode-ACI 高 4.2pp，\n      说明快速适应在实际部署中有价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S3: COC-ACI vs Episode-ACI\"\n        description: \"Convergence speed, final performance, early performance\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S3: ACI convergence curve — COC vs episode-level, showing faster convergence of COC\"\n    analysis: >\n      最终性能近似说明 ACI 的 asymptotic 行为不依赖信号源质量（只要信号与 coverage\n      相关，最终都收敛到 target coverage）。COC 的价值在于 (a) 收敛速度, (b) 无需外部监督。\n      这是 Claim 2 的\"自参考\"子论点的独立验证。\n\n  - name: \"Ablation A7 — DiU Aleatoric vs CGS Epistemic Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"CRM 分别使用 DiU aleatoric features (7D)、CGS epistemic features (45D)、combined (52D) 作为输入。\"\n    expected_results:\n      a7_diu_aleatoric_libero_plus_success: 63.9\n      a7_cgs_epistemic_libero_plus_success: 72.8\n      a7_combined_52d_libero_plus_success: 73.5\n      a7_diu_vs_cgs_gap: 8.9\n      a7_combined_vs_cgs_gap: 0.7\n      a7_diu_libero_nominal_success: 94.8\n      a7_diu_nominal_drop: 2.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      DiU 估计的 aleatoric uncertainty 反映数据固有噪声，在 nominal 和 OOD 条件下\n      都可能较高（如 gripper action 本身就有 stochasticity）。这导致两个问题：\n      (1) 在 nominal 条件下 CRM 过度干预（2.5pp drop），因为 aleatoric uncertainty\n      在正常情况下也不为零，CRM 无法区分\"固有噪声\"和\"需要校正\"；\n      (2) 在 OOD 条件下信号不如 epistemic 清晰——CGS 的 epistemic uncertainty 在\n      分布偏移时显著升高而在 nominal 时低，提供了更干净的\"是否需要校正\"信号。\n      Combined 52D 仅比 CGS 45D 好 0.7pp：aleatoric 信息的边际价值很小，\n      因为 epistemic features 已经捕获了绝大部分可利用的结构。\n      这验证了 paper framing 中\"CGS captures epistemic, DiU captures aleatoric\"的区分，\n      以及 epistemic uncertainty 对 action correction 更有用的论点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S4: Epistemic vs Aleatoric Uncertainty Features\"\n        description: \"DiU / CGS / Combined 三路对比, nominal + LIBERO-Plus\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S4: Per-DOF uncertainty magnitude — DiU vs CGS 在 nominal 和 OOD 条件下的分布对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      8.9pp 差距是对 reviewer concern \"DiU 更高效\" 的直接回应：效率不是唯一考量，\n      epistemic vs aleatoric 的信号质量差异更重要。DiU 在 nominal 上的 2.5pp drop\n      是额外的 evidence point——aleatoric conditioning 在没有分布偏移时反而有害。\n      Combined 的微弱改善不 justify 52D 的额外复杂度，支持了 45D CGS-only 的设计选择。\n\n  - name: \"Feature Importance Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"CRM 对 45 个 uncertainty 特征的梯度 magnitude 分析，按 perturbation type 分解。\"\n    expected_results:\n      top_features_overall: [\"conformal_radius_x\", \"conformal_radius_y\", \"conformal_radius_z\", \"std_x\", \"ellipsoid_volume\", \"std_y\"]\n      conformal_radius_gradient_share: 0.48\n      std_gradient_share: 0.31\n      ellipsoid_volume_gradient_share: 0.21\n      camera_perturbation_top_feature: \"conformal_radius_x\"\n      noise_perturbation_top_feature: \"std_z\"\n      robot_state_top_feature: \"conformal_radius_joint3\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conformal radius 是最重要的特征类别（48% gradient share），因为它直接编码了\n      \"在该 DOF 上 conformal set 有多宽\"——这是 calibrated 的 uncertainty measure，\n      比 raw std 更稳定。Per-DOF std 次之（31%），提供互补的 raw dispersion 信息。\n      Ellipsoid volume（全局标量）虽然只有 21% 但在所有 perturbation type 上贡献一致，\n      作为\"整体 uncertainty level\"的 contextual feature。\n      关键发现：不同 perturbation type 下 CRM 关注的 DOF 不同——camera shift 主要\n      影响 xyz 平移因此 conformal_radius_{x,y,z} 梯度高；robot-state perturbation\n      主要影响关节角因此 conformal_radius_joint* 梯度高。这是\"维度选择性校正\"的\n      直接机制证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Feature Importance by Category\"\n        description: \"3 feature categories × 7 perturbation types 的 gradient magnitude matrix\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 13: Feature importance heatmap — 45 features × 7 perturbation types, gradient magnitude\"\n      - \"Fig 14: Top-3 features per perturbation type, showing dimension-selective attention pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      Feature importance 分析提供了 Claim 1 的机制解释：CRM 不是黑盒——它确实在利用\n      per-DOF conformal 结构做维度选择性校正。不同 perturbation 下关注不同 DOF 的模式\n      与物理直觉一致。这是 reviewer 最可能 appreciate 的 interpretability result。\n\n  - name: \"SnapFlow Integration — K=10 × 1-Step Distilled Sampling\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"用 SnapFlow 1-step distilled generation 替代标准 flow-matching 多步采样。测试样本多样性和推理加速。\"\n    expected_results:\n      snapflow_libero_plus_success: 71.2\n      snapflow_vs_full_gap: 1.6\n      snapflow_sample_diversity_ratio: 0.87\n      snapflow_inference_time_ms: 38\n      standard_inference_time_ms: 185\n      snapflow_speedup: 4.9\n      snapflow_libero_nominal_success: 96.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      SnapFlow 1-step distilled generation 将 K=10 的采样时间从 ~185ms 降至 ~38ms\n      (4.9x speedup)，因为跳过了 flow-matching 的迭代 ODE 求解。\n      样本多样性保留 87%（用 K=10 样本集的 average pairwise distance 衡量）：\n      distillation 轻微压缩了分布尾部，但核心的 inter-sample covariance 结构保留。\n      LIBERO-Plus 上仅损失 1.6pp，因为 CGS 在稍低多样性下仍能提取有意义的\n      per-DOF 特征——Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 对 slightly lower effective K 鲁棒。\n      这为实时部署场景提供了 practical speedup 且性能损失可接受。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S5: SnapFlow vs Standard Sampling\"\n        description: \"Inference time, sample diversity, downstream success\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S5: Inference time breakdown — standard vs SnapFlow, showing per-component cost\"\n    analysis: >\n      4.9x speedup 在 1.6pp 代价下是合理的 engineering tradeoff。\n      87% 样本多样性保留说明 1-step distillation 保留了足够的 epistemic information。\n      这不是核心科学贡献但是重要的 practical result，回应了 reviewer 可能的\n      \"K=10 采样太慢\" concern。可放在 supplementary 或 practical considerations section。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e2723979-e9f9-4088-b123-1516654979e0","total_cost_usd":0.381452,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11066,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":12009,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11066,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12009,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11066},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6024,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006134,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12009,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11066,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.37531800000000004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4c099dc7-5048-4f47-9615-b8e0acac609f"}
